  "description": {
   "en": "Taku, a high school student, is depressed after being classified as on the verge of obesity. At an event he attended to heal his heartbreak, his favorite cosplayer, Shiramine Lil, asked him to do something for her. At Lil's request, he starts training at home!?\n___\n**Supervisor:** [OGATORE](https://mangadex.org/author/846cc757-6323-4720-90b1-398163bce82d)\n\n**Alt Official Raw:** [G's Channel](https://gs-ch.com/articles/contents/arvDmbrh7s5vuLyhzc7MEpYJ)",
   "ja": "鞍池拓(クライケタク)は、ちょっぴり肥満ぎみなことを気にする男子高校生。ある会場で、憧れのコスプレイヤー・白観音(シラミネ)リルと出会った拓はリルからのお願いで引き締まった体を目指すことに――!?",
   "pt-br": "Taku, um estudante do ensino médio, está deprimido depois de ser diagnosticado com obesidade. Em um evento que ele participou para curar sua dor de cotovelo, uma mulher que ele gostava pediu para ele fazer algo… ele começa a treinar em casa!"
  },
